  "definition": "Compliance and Performance Testing for Small MWC Units",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-09-27",
  "historyNote": "#7704, eff 6-7-02; ss by #9084, eff 2-2-08; ss by #11131, eff 7-18-16; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18",
